{'symbol': 'KMB', 'date': '2022-10-21 12:59:00', 'title': 'KIMBERLY-CLARK CELEBRATES 150 YEARS OF PURPOSE-LED INNOVATION', 'text': 'DALLAS , OCT. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KIMBERLY-CLARK (NYSE: KMB) IS MARKING THE 150TH ANNIVERSARY OF THE COMPANY\'S FIRST PRODUCT SOLD AND CELEBRATING ITS ONGOING LEADERSHIP IN CATEGORY DEFINING INNOVATION THAT LED THE COMPANY TO CREATE FIVE OF THE CATEGORIES IT COMPETES IN, AND INTRODUCE PRODUCTS AND TECHNOLOGIES THAT MAKE A DIFFERENCE IN THE LIVES OF BILLIONS OF PEOPLE EACH DAY. EXPERIENCE THE FULL INTERACTIVE MULTICHANNEL NEWS RELEASE HERE: HTTPS://WWW.MULTIVU.COM/PLAYERS/ENGLISH/9037451-KIMBERLY-CLARK-CELEBRATES-150-YEARS/ "FOR 150 YEARS, OUR TEAM HAS TRANSFORMED INSIGHTS INTO NEW CATEGORIES AND PRODUCTS THAT HAVE MADE A DIFFERENCE IN THE LIVES OF BILLIONS OF PEOPLE AROUND THE WORLD," SAID MIKE HSU, CHAIRMAN AND CEO OF KIMBERLY-CLARK.'}